# Environment setup

Copy this file to `.env.local` for local development. Use the same variable names in Vercel Environment Variables, with separate values for Preview and Production.

```env
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000
```

`SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` must only be used in server-side code or Supabase Edge Functions. It must never be exposed through a `NEXT_PUBLIC_` variable or sent to the browser.
